{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":20017748,"chapterID":15000303,"chapterNumber":"III-3","sectionNumber":"33-293","title":"Required yards along district boundary coincident with side lot line of zoning lot in a Commercial District","officialText":"","previewText":"C1 C2 C3 C4 C5 C6 C7 C8\n\nIn all districts, as indicated, along such portion of a side lot line of a zoning lot in a Commercial District that coincides with a rear lot line of a zoning lot in an adjoining Residence District, an open area at curb level of at least the width set forth in the following table shall be provided along such boundary within the Commercial District. Such an open area shall not be used for acce","blocks":[{"id":"zr-17748-block-001","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>C1 C2 C3 C4 C5 C6 C7 C8</span></p>","plainText":"C1 C2 C3 C4 C5 C6 C7 C8"},{"id":"zr-17748-block-002","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>In all districts, as indicated, along such portion of a <strong><em>side lot line</em></strong> of a <strong><em>zoning lot</em></strong> in a <strong><em>Commercial District</em></strong> that coincides with a <strong><em>rear lot line</em></strong> of a <strong><em>zoning lot</em></strong> in an adjoining <strong><em>Residence District</em></strong>, an open area at <strong><em>curb level</em></strong> of at least the width set forth in the following table shall be provided along such boundary within the <strong><em>Commercial District</em></strong>. Such an open area shall not be used for <strong><em>accessory</em></strong> off-street loading, or for storage or processing of any kind.</span></p>","plainText":"In all districts, as indicated, along such portion of a side lot line of a zoning lot in a Commercial District that coincides with a rear lot line of a zoning lot in an adjoining Residence District, an open area at curb level of at least the width set forth in the following table shall be provided along such boundary within the Commercial District. Such an open area shall not be used for accessory off-street loading, or for storage or processing of any kind."},{"id":"zr-17748-block-003","kind":"html","html":"<p><a id=\"t.5c29f721f1814895293e99cffec60a4599a77069\"></a><a id=\"t.11\"></a></p>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-17748-block-004","kind":"table","html":"<table style=\"margin-left:auto;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse;margin-right:auto\"><tbody><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right-style:solid;padding:0pt 6pt 0pt 6pt;border-bottom-color:<strong><em>000000;border-top-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-left-color:</em></strong>000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:<strong><em>000000;border-left-width:0pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:184.5pt;border-top-color:</em></strong>000000;border-bottom-style:solid\">\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t<p><span>Districts</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right-style:solid;padding:0pt 6pt 0pt 6pt;border-bottom-color:<strong><em>000000;border-top-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-left-color:</em></strong>000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:<strong><em>000000;border-left-width:0pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:189pt;border-top-color:</em></strong>000000;border-bottom-style:solid\">\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t<p><span>Required Width of <strong><em>Yard</em></strong> (in feet)</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right-style:solid;padding:0pt 6pt 0pt 6pt;border-bottom-color:<strong><em>000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-left-color:</em></strong>000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:<strong><em>000000;border-left-width:0pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0pt;width:184.5pt;border-top-color:</em></strong>000000;border-bottom-style:solid\">\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t<p><span>C1 C2 C3 C4 C5 C6 C7</span></p